[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/comments/846457708","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/18067#issuecomment-846457708","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/18067","id":846457708,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDg0NjQ1NzcwOA==","user":{"login":"dan9er","id":67669146,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NjY5MTQ2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67669146?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dan9er","html_url":"https://github.com/dan9er","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dan9er/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dan9er/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dan9er/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dan9er/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dan9er/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dan9er/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dan9er/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dan9er/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dan9er/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-05-22T20:10:18Z","updated_at":"2021-05-22T20:10:18Z","body":"It appears zstr expects to be installed directly in `include/`, not `include/zstr/`. There's two fixes that could be made:\r\n\r\n#### 1. Install directly into `include/`\r\nChange this line:\r\nhttps://github.com/microsoft/vcpkg/blob/a3db16a4475b963cacf0260068c497fb72c8f3c0/ports/zstr/portfile.cmake#L12\r\nto:\r\n```cmake\r\n     DESTINATION ${CURRENT_PACKAGES_DIR}/include)\r\n```\r\nThis is the simplest fix, although segmentation is lost. This may be an issue especially with `strict_fstream.hpp`.\r\n\r\n#### 2. Patch includes to point inside `include/zstr/`\r\nPrepend all of zstr's internal includes with `zstr/`. This keeps segmentation, but is more complicated. Plus, the contributing guidelines state to avoid patching whenever possible.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/comments/846457708/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"dan9er","id":67669146,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NjY5MTQ2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67669146?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dan9er","html_url":"https://github.com/dan9er","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dan9er/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dan9er/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dan9er/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dan9er/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dan9er/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dan9er/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dan9er/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dan9er/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dan9er/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":4782705265,"node_id":"MDE1OlJlZmVyZW5jZWRFdmVudDQ3ODI3MDUyNjU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vcpkg/issues/events/4782705265","actor":{"login":"dan9er","id":67669146,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NjY5MTQ2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67669146?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dan9er","html_url":"https://github.com/dan9er","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dan9er/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dan9er/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dan9er/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dan9er/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dan9er/subscriptions","orga